# {{lb|en|informal}} An [[error]].
# {{lb|en|baseball|slang|1800s}} A [[fly ball]] that is weakly [[hit]] just over the [[infielders]].
# {{lb|en|informal}} A film or videotaped [[outtake]] that has recorded an amusing mistake and/or accident during the course of regular filming.
# {{lb|en|nautical}} A kind of [[sail]], a [[spanker]].

